-2019-05-08","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-old-friends-and-new-2019-05-08#:~:text=Mistress%20Kaya%20said%2C%20%22Run.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"War of the Spark: Ravnica—Old Friends and New\" by Greg Weisman. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 May 2019."}},{"id":"war-spark-ravnica-old-friends-and-new-2019-05-08-e12","summary":"Jace, Lavinia, Gideon, Teferi, Chandra, Jaya, Ajani and Karn arrive and join the fight, and Gideon names the enemy the Eternals.","participants":["jace-beleren","lavinia","gideon-jura","teferi","chandra-nalaar","jaya-ballard","ajani-goldmane","karn","the-eternals"],"location":"tenth-district-plaza","importance":"major","page":"stories/war-spark-ravnica-old-friends-and-new-2019-05-08","order":219,"story_date":"2019-05-08","storyline":"War of the Spark","source":"wizards","paragraph":206,"quote":"Form up! The Eternals are still coming! We need to save as many people as possible!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-old-friends-and-new-2019-05-08#:~:text=Form%20up%21%20The%20Eternals,many%20people%20as%20possible%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"War of the Spark: Ravnica—Old Friends and New","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Greg Weisman"],"date":"2019-05-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-old-friends-and-new-2019-05-08","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-old-friends-and-new-2019-05-08#:~:text=Form%20up%21%20The%20Eternals,many%20people%20as%20possible%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"War of the Spark: Ravnica—Old Friends and New\" by Greg Weisman. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 May 2019."}},{"id":"war-spark-ravnica-path-opulent-2019-05-15-e0","summary":"Rat, stunned by news of Hekara's death, stabs an Eternal about to kill Teyo, and Kaya takes Rat and Teyo with her.","participants":["rat","teyo